# KMP Architecture and Coding Guidelines

Follow the centralized project rules in `.agents/`:
- **Guardrails:** `.agents/rules/kmp-architecture-guardrails.md`
- **Planner:** `.agents/skills/kmp-planner/SKILL.md`
- **Generator:** `.agents/skills/kmp-feature-generator/SKILL.md`
- **Reviewer:** `.agents/skills/kmp-code-reviewer/SKILL.md`
- **QA:** `.agents/skills/kmp-qa-runner/SKILL.md`

## Key Constraints
- Keep `sharedLogic/` pure Kotlin without platform-specific UI frameworks.
- Do NOT touch `build.gradle.kts`, `local.properties`, `gradle.properties`, or `iosApp.xcodeproj/`.
- Validate via `./gradlew :sharedLogic:build`.
